# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# error <field> <norm> <expected> <tolerance>
# Case defaults with -seedProfile flat: N 10, Pe_L 46, constant ball through the graph, gmsh 4.15.2, seed 1. Tolerances
# cover the spread over gmsh mesh seeds 1 to 4 and leave a margin for other gmsh versions.
error  eps        L2  0.012167243  0.0035
error  eps_bulk   L2  0.010191692  0.003
error  eps_wall   L2  0.0065907566  0.001
error  grad_bulk  L2  0.070653808  0.003
